            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>=</code> işaretini kullanarak <code>spaceship</code> değişkenine <code>\"Enterprise\"</code> dize değerini ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spaceship = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Enterprise&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
