            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi işaret <code>true</code> değerini <code>false</code> değerine dönüştürür?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>!</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>-</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>?</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>!</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
